{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2022-11/1065811/block/singleImage/3278543/df/2022%E5%85%83%E6%9C%97%E5%88%86%E5%8D%80%E8%AD%A6%E7%BD%B2_1.jpg?updatedAt=1795663446\"/><figcaption>元朗警署。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>元朗一個街市發生盜竊案。 今日（26日）早上近8時，元朗錦田街巿一名魚檔檔主返回檔口開檔，發現有魚不翼而飛，懷疑被人偷去，於是報警。警方接報後到場調查，姓王檔主在場稱，後門沒有上鎖，確實損失的數量有待點算，暫時未能確定，初步估計約2,000元。警方將案列「盜竊」跟進，暫時未有人被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T03:50:41.453897+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T02:55:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T19:17:33.893480+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:44:04.238971+00:00","content_hash":"4b3c2a8d9b51bbbf663b2521e0c114ab1f57a2076a4e87a9cfcc041d52e6393e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T03:50:41.453897+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}